      "text": "\n$0.25 \\mathrm{~A}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/Kw2ny53nH6GJ9Vdz0Gm4lwdmLJCEWc_iYXMPqlctjXg.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nIn steady state capacitor is fully charged hence no current will flow through line 2.\nBy simplyfing the circuit<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/tb1veEjmkwMnuboQCsTv4zZPSRwcYe-BW__tR6Yzdu0.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nHence resultant potential difference across resistances will be $8.0 \\mathrm{~V}$.\nThus current $\\mathrm{I}=\\frac{\\mathrm{V}}{\\mathrm{R}}=\\frac{8.0}{3+9}=\\frac{8}{12}$\nor, $\\mathrm{I}=\\frac{2}{3}=0.67 \\mathrm{~A}$",
